@startuml ciclo-vida-orchestrator
title Ciclo de vida del Orchestrator

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor<<start>> #LightGreen
    BackgroundColor<<stop>> #LightCoral
    BackgroundColor<<warn>> #LightYellow
}

state "Arrancando" as Arrancando <<start>>
state "Validando" as Validando
state "Cargando Estado" as Cargando
state "Listo" as Listo {
    state "Sirviendo XML-RPC" as RPC
    state "Backup Loop" as Backup
    RPC --> Backup : cada 300s
    Backup --> RPC
}
state "Apagando" as Apagando <<stop>>

[*] --> Arrancando : systemd start

Arrancando --> Validando : check_dependencies()
Validando --> Cargando : validate_tokens_at_startup()
Validando --> Arrancando <<warn>> : tokens inseguros / faltantes

Cargando --> Listo : state.load_state()
Cargando --> Apagando <<warn>> : fallo carga

Listo --> Apagando : SIGINT / systemctl stop
Apagando --> [*] : state.persist()\nserver_close()

note right of Listo
  **ThreadingMixIn**: un thread por RPC
  **Backup loop**: thread aparte cada BACKUP_INTERVAL_SEC (300s)
  **31 handlers XML-RPC** registrados en /RPC2
end note

@enduml
